{"4262250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Skyscraper Security: Zombie Rain", "steam_appid": 4262250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE DEAD ARE RAINING FROM THE SKY</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skyscraper Security: Zombie Rain is a fast first-person action roguelike set above a neon cyberpunk city. Hold your ground against falling infected, shape a lethal build, and survive 15 escalating waves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR DEFENDER</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a combat doctrine and combine powerful in-run upgrades. Adapt your build as the threat intensifies and turn every weapon into a specialized killing machine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEND TIME</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use bullet time to control the chaos, line up critical shots, and recover when the rooftop becomes overwhelmed. Timing is as important as firepower.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE SHIFT</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every wave brings greater numbers and deadlier threats. Learn their behavior, prioritize targets, and survive long enough to complete your assignment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE YOUR CALLSIGN KNOWN</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push for higher scores, improve your wave results, and compete for a place on the global leaderboard. Every fallen Defender contributes to the worldwide death report.</p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast first-person arena combat<br></li><li>15 escalating waves<br></li><li>Distinct combat doctrines<br></li><li>Run-defining upgrades<br></li><li>Bullet time and time manipulation<br></li><li>Persistent progression and unlocks<br></li><li>Global scores and worldwide statistics</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE DEAD ARE RAINING FROM THE SKY</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skyscraper Security: Zombie Rain is a fast first-person action roguelike set above a neon cyberpunk city. Hold your ground against falling infected, shape a lethal build, and survive 15 escalating waves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR DEFENDER</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a combat doctrine and combine powerful in-run upgrades. Adapt your build as the threat intensifies and turn every weapon into a specialized killing machine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEND TIME</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use bullet time to control the chaos, line up critical shots, and recover when the rooftop becomes overwhelmed. Timing is as important as firepower.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE SHIFT</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every wave brings greater numbers and deadlier threats. Learn their behavior, prioritize targets, and survive long enough to complete your assignment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE YOUR CALLSIGN KNOWN</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push for higher scores, improve your wave results, and compete for a place on the global leaderboard. Every fallen Defender contributes to the worldwide death report.</p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast first-person arena combat<br></li><li>15 escalating waves<br></li><li>Distinct combat doctrines<br></li><li>Run-defining upgrades<br></li><li>Bullet time and time manipulation<br></li><li>Persistent progression and unlocks<br></li><li>Global scores and worldwide statistics</li></ul>", "short_description": "Defend a neon megacity from zombies raining from the sky in a fast first-person action roguelike. Choose a doctrine, bend time, build devastating upgrades, survive 15 escalating waves, and chase a place on the global leaderboard.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262250/d882f630c1a83984aaf7f6cc1544d7f5dc30bd85/header.jpg?t=1787557859", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262250/4988ce54732c8f63aa83451811c20d73326e4017/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787557859", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s